  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IAP Erikshj&#xE4;lpen Kos 2004</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOP Erikshj&#xE4;lpen Kos 2004</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att genom sj&#xE4;lvhj&#xE4;lp rekonstruera 60 hus i fyra orter i Kosovo f&#xF6;r minoriteter, vilket sammantaget kommer att p&#xE5;verka cirka 600 personer. It innefattar ocks&#xE5; visst st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r att &#xE5;stadkomma m&#xF6;jligheter till ekonomiskt oberoende. Minoriteter omfattar framf&#xF6;r allt serber, roma, ashkali och &quot;egyptians&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at through self assistance reconstruct 60 houses for minorities in four municipalities in Kosovo, which will  altogether affect approximately 600 persons. It also includes certain assistance in order to create self sustainability. Minorities consist primarilly of Serbs, Roma, Ashkali and Egyptians.</narrative>
  </description>
